the infrastructure storage,

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:02.870
which is Google Cloud Storage.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:03.560
Right.

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:05.510
So what is Google
Cloud Storage then?

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:10.250
Google Cloud Storage
offers a unified API

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.190
